{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_0cd17a6323204bf486f6b0c193151fca","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The output/index.html faithfully renders the reference, matches visually, has zero console errors, and navigation works. Delivery is complete.\n\nI recreated the Corravale University site from observation as a self-contained React 19 + Tailwind 4 + TypeScript app in `/workspace/recreation`, built with `npm run build` and copied to `/workspace/recreation/output/index.html`.\n\nDelivered:\n- 20 routed pages with path-based client-side routing: Home, About, Academics, Life at Corravale, Athletics, Research, Health & Medicine, Initiatives, Giving, Prospective Students, Current Students, Faculty & Staff, Parents, Alumni, Schools & Colleges, Facts & Figures, Contact, Search, and Privacy Notice.\n- Shared `Header` (logo, Report link, search, audience bar, Quick Links, blue main nav), `Footer` (campuses, contact, social feeds, compliance badges), `SidebarPage`/`Voices`/`PageTitle`/`ProsePage` layout components, and hand-authored SVG icons reused across pages.\n- Home sections: hero, infographic cards, News / In The News, Videos, Happening (Events + Academic Calendar), and Seize Today gallery — all populated with the reference text and binary media.\n- Original class names and components; media copied only from the loopback origin via the asset helper; Roboto/Roboto Condensed bundled locally as woff2.\n\nVerified: builds cleanly, output is a single self-contained `index.html`, an internal navigation (About → Athletics → Health & Medicine via clicks) works, desktop 1920×1080 and mobile 375×812 layouts both render correctly, and the browser console reports zero errors."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2355262,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0c9ab75-d